{#
  The rail shared by the Badges pages of the Espace chefs d'U (issue #621,
  docs/chantiers/CHANTIER-badges.md) — through partials/page_picker.html.twig,
  never a copy of its markup.

  The tabs carry the years (« 2026-2027 »), never « Année en cours »: it
  reads at a glance, and it does not turn false during the year
  transition. Requires `current_path` and `badges_current_year_label` in
  scope.
#}
{% include 'partials/page_picker.html.twig' with {
    picker_id: 'badges-page-picker',
    pages: [
        {'url': '/admin/badges', 'label': badges_current_year_label},
        {'url': '/admin/badges/configuration', 'label': 'Configuration'},
    ],
    current_path: current_path,
    aria_label: 'Pages Badges',
} only %}
